<tr>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>cdp</code></td>
<td class=3D"org-left">opam</td>
<td class=3D"org-left">Typed protocol domains: records, enums, commands, ev=
ents, with JSON codecs. Transport-agnostic.</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>cdp-gen</code></td>
<td class=3D"org-left">opam</td>
<td class=3D"org-left">The generator CLI: protocol JSON in, OCaml out. Any =
revision, your own domain selection.</td>
