<div id=3D"outline-container-org76cc34a" class=3D"outline-4">
<h4 id=3D"org76cc34a">Why cdp-lwt is not on opam yet</h4>
<div class=3D"outline-text-4" id=3D"text-org76cc34a">
<p>
<code>cdp-lwt</code> uses libcurl's WebSocket API through the <code>curl</c=
ode> bindings. That API is on ocurl's master branch, but not in any ocurl r=
elease yet. <code>cdp-lwt</code> builds fine from a clone (its opam file pi=
ns ocurl master). As soon as ocurl makes a release, <code>cdp-lwt</code> fo=
llows onto opam.
</p>
</div>
</div>
